    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Overview</h2>Alkurai is an immersive co-op Fantasy Horror game for 1-4 players. The kingdom of Alkurai has been seized by the now infamous Alchemist. His true intentions are unknown, but his &quot;miscreations&quot; have resulted in the loss of countless lives. A job listing has been put up across the world with a generous reward. You and your party must rise to the occasion and save the kingdom of Alkurai.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Chapters</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Alkurai's Royal Garden<br><i> Alkurai's Dungeon<br>The Castle</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Gameplay </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 1-4 Players</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Intricate Puzzle Progression<br></li><li> Maze/Dungeon style maps<br></li><li> Linear Game Progression<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unique Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> An inspired Dark Fantasy Horror Game<br></li><li> Original Story and Lore<br></li><li> Drinking Mechanic<br></li><li> Sanity Bar </li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Early Access</h2>This is a new game, bugs are mostly out of the game but with your help and submitting them in our discord we will be able to see them and work on them, thank you and the community</li></ul></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Overview</h2>Alkurai is an immersive co-op Fantasy Horror game for 1-4 players. The kingdom of Alkurai has been seized by the now infamous Alchemist. His true intentions are unknown, but his &quot;miscreations&quot; have resulted in the loss of countless lives. A job listing has been put up across the world with a generous reward. You and your party must rise to the occasion and save the kingdom of Alkurai.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Chapters</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Alkurai's Royal Garden<br><i> Alkurai's Dungeon<br>The Castle</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Gameplay </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 1-4 Players</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Intricate Puzzle Progression<br></li><li> Maze/Dungeon style maps<br></li><li> Linear Game Progression<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unique Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> An inspired Dark Fantasy Horror Game<br></li><li> Original Story and Lore<br></li><li> Drinking Mechanic<br></li><li> Sanity Bar </li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Early Access</h2>This is a new game, bugs are mostly out of the game but with your help and submitting them in our discord we will be able to see them and work on them, thank you and the community</li></ul></li></ul>",
